"Install the app (the CLI ships inside it), or use Homebrew: brew install --cask huynhtrungthoai/cleanpilot/cleanpilot, which also puts /opt/homebrew/bin/diskwise on your PATH." = "Installiere die App (die CLI steckt darin) oder nutze Homebrew: brew install --cask huynhtrungthoai/cleanpilot/cleanpilot – das legt auch /opt/homebrew/bin/diskwise in deinen PATH.";
